    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Measure ring-by-ring oviduct pressure and egg deformation before calcification across species and experimentally model whether those pressures predict final shape better than nesting ecology and intrinsic membrane properties. Accurate pressure-based prediction and weak independent nesting effects support the claim; the reverse refutes it.";
