    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "No known public dataset contains pre-shell pressure fields linked to final egg form.", "Pressure, membrane mechanics and secretion are jointly determined.", "The claim's 'essential cause' requires causal comparison with ecological alternatives.";
